4C">Excellent</span></a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px">Choose a number to open the survey page with it already selected. You can add a comment there before sending.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#5C564C">This link works once and expires in 30 days. It is an automatic message; replying to it adds to your request.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:0 32px"><div style="padding:12px 16px;border-radius:6px;background:#F7F5F0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#403C35"><span style="font-weight:500">Request</span> <bdi style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace">[HD-1042]</bdi> · Refund for order 8841<br><span style="color:#5C564C">Reply to this email to add to your request. Keep the reference in the subject.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 24px 32px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#5C564C">Helpdock<br>You are receiving this because you contacted Helpdock support.</td></tr></table></body></html>"`;

exports[`renderDelivery, a satisfaction survey > matches the English artboard > text 1`] = `
"Hi Mona,

Lina closed your request HD-1042 today. We would like to know how it went.

How would you rate the help you received?

1 · Very bad   https://desk.helpdock.io/csat/tok?rating=1&lang=en
2 · Bad        https://desk.helpdock.io/csat/tok?rating=2&lang=en
3 · Okay       https://desk.helpdock.io/csat/tok?rating=3&lang=en
4 · Good       https://desk.helpdock.io/csat/tok?rating=4&lang=en
5 · Excellent  https://desk.helpdock.io/csat/tok?rating=5&lang=en

This link works once and expires in 30 days. It is an automatic message; replying to it adds to your request.

Request [HD-1042] · Refund for order 8841
Reply to this email to add to your request. Keep the reference in the subject.

Helpdock
You are receiving this because you contacted Helpdock support."
`;
